WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.183
- Let's face it.

00:00:01.183 --> 00:00:02.016
When you're trying to get God

00:00:02.016 --> 00:00:03.410
to intervene on your behalf,

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:06.150
silent prayer is only
going to get you so far.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.360
So it was only a matter of
time until someone sued God.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.970
According to many religious traditions,

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:11.990
God created the universe.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.510
So really when you think about it,

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:16.900
it's only fair that he or she should pay

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.010
for the damages that they've caused.

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:21.180
And in fact, the last part of a complaint,

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.520
the thing that starts a lawsuit,

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:26.830
is called a Prayer For Relief
and that is not a coincidence,

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:29.900
except that it completely
is just a coincidence.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.870
So let's look at some instances
where people have tried

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:34.810
to bring God and Satan to justice.

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:36.910
The first is where a man sued Satan

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.750
and his staff for his own problems.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:42.630
In 1971, Gerald Mayo filed
a class action lawsuit

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:44.750
against Satan and his staff,

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:46.870
because I guess like any
small business owner,

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:49.430
Satan relies on clerical
workers to dot the I's

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:50.530
and cross the T's.

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:53.500
Mayo, a 22-year-old inmate
at Western Penitentiary

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.677
in Pittsburgh, alleged
the following quote,

00:00:55.677 --> 00:00:58.770
"Satan has on numerous occasions
caused plaintiff misery

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:01.470
and unwanted threats against
the will of plaintiff,

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:04.550
that Satan has placed deliberate
obstacles in his path,

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:06.500
and caused plaintiff's downfall.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.900
And by reason of these acts,

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.760
Satan has deprived him of
his constitutional rights."

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:13.550
Yes, that is an actual federal court case.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:16.440
Mayo had filed his
complaint in forma pauperis,

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:17.273
which in Latin,

00:01:17.273 --> 00:01:20.450
translates to in the manner
or character of a pauper.

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:22.940
This allows for an indigent
party to get court costs waived

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:26.170
and is most commonly used
by inmates filing suit.

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:28.440
However, a federal court will still reject

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.810
a prisoner's application under
the following circumstances,

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:33.280
that the allegation of poverty is untrue,

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:35.070
the action is frivolous or malicious,

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:36.390
the complaint does not state a claim

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:37.640
on which relief can be granted,

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:40.160
or an inmate sues a
defendant for money damages

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.630
and that defendant is
immune from liability

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:44.160
for money damages.

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:48.100
Pennsylvania Judge Gerald
Weber denied Mayo's petition

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:49.560
on the third ground writing that,

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:51.010
this court has serious doubts

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.840
that the complaint
reveals a cause of action

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.490
upon which relief can
be granted by the court.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:58.260
In a one page order dripping with irony,

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:01.090
Judge Weber detailed other
issues Mayo might have had

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:03.600
in regard to suing the prince of darkness.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:04.630
Judge Weber questioned

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:07.160
whether the court even has
jurisdiction to hear the case,

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:09.980
noting that Mayo failed to
allege whether Satan even lives

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.747
in the Western district of Pennsylvania,

00:02:11.747 --> 00:02:13.880
while noting that there
is no official case

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:16.250
in which the devil has
appeared as a defendant,

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:18.297
Judge Weber jokingly referred to quote,

00:02:18.297 --> 00:02:20.230
"an unofficial account of a trial

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:22.690
in New Hampshire, where this
defendant filed an action

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:25.160
of mortgage foreclosure as plaintiff."

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.950
This was a reference to the short story,

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.710
The Devil and Daniel Webster,

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:30.250
where a farmer who sells his soul

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:33.040
to the devil is defended
before a jury of the damned

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:36.100
by famous 19th century
American statesman, lawyer,

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:37.810
and order Daniel Webster.

00:02:37.810 --> 00:02:38.643
Though, if you're like me,

00:02:38.643 --> 00:02:39.670
you're probably more familiar

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:41.690
with the treehouse of horror story,

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:43.100
the devil and Homer Simpson.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.520
- I'd sell my soul for a donut.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:48.800
- Which is basically
exactly the same story.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:51.320
In this context, Judge Weber
noted, without deciding,

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.960
that as a foreign prince,
Satan might be able

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:56.720
to claim sovereign immunity
to shield him from litigation.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:57.940
In rejecting this complaint,

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:00.300
Judge Weber also highlighted
another potential issue,

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:03.130
namely that Mayo could not
satisfy the requirements

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:05.030
to bring a class action lawsuit.

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:07.570
Under Federal Rule of Civil Procedure 23,

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:09.470
Judge Weber noted that
while Mayo might be able

00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:10.830
to meet the first three requirements

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.050
of a class action suit,

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:13.410
the court was unable to determine

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:14.590
whether Mayo could fairly

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.430
and adequately protect the interests

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:18.810
of the class that he was
purporting to represent.

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:21.200
And finally, in denying Mayo's petition,

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:23.270
Judge Weber noted that Mayo had failed

00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:24.740
to provide specific instructions

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:27.710
to US Marshals for how to
serve Satan with a complaint.

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:30.260
But this lawsuit shows why
it's so hard to sue the devil.

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:32.280
All these rules of civil
procedure were written

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:36.110
by people who are already
working for the devil, lawyers.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.080
But then there's the
man who tried to sue God

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.460
to stop natural disasters.

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.830
One of the most devastating effects

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:43.560
of climate change has been the increase

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:45.439
of severe weather events,
such as flash flooding,

00:03:45.439 --> 00:03:47.860
and more frequent and
destructive hurricanes.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:51.020
And most of the proposed
solutions for dealing

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:54.900
with increasing natural disasters
involve regulating carbon

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.060
and shifting to renewable energy sources,

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:58.770
which are boring.
(buzzer sounds)

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:01.940
But in 2007, one Nebraska
State Senator opted

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:03.440
for a more direct approach.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:05.650
Get a court order against God prohibiting

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:07.520
from any more destruction.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.810
Enter Nebraska State
Senator Ernie Chambers,

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:13.320
who left office in 2021
after a record 46 years

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:15.130
in Nebraska's legislature.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:16.660
Senator Chambers is no stranger

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.970
to standing out among his
more conservative colleagues.

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:21.030
During his career, he
would don a sweatshirt

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.580
and jeans instead of a jacket and tie.

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:26.020
And as an avowed agnostic
in the devout state,

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:27.730
Senator Chambers made no secret

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.460
of his lack of religious faith.

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:31.140
In his 2007 complaint,

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:32.887
the Senator accused God of causing quote,

00:04:32.887 --> 00:04:34.850
"fearsome floods, horrendous hurricanes,

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:36.150
terrifying tornadoes,

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:38.460
and of making terroristic
threats against the Senator

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:41.377
and his constituents, inspiring
fear and causing" quote,

00:04:41.377 --> 00:04:43.820
"widespread death,
destruction, and terrorization

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:46.640
of millions upon millions
of the Earth's inhabitants."

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.280
And Senator Chambers based his ability

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:49.517
to sue God as quote,

00:04:49.517 --> 00:04:51.130
"that defendant, being omnipresent,

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:53.500
is personally present in Douglas County."

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.030
And in his Prayer for Relief,

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:57.440
Senator Chambers requested
a permanent injunction,

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:00.300
ordering defendant to cease
certain harmful activities

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.190
and making terroristic threats.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.070
And in 2008,

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.510
Douglas County District
Court Judge Marlon Polk

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:07.910
threw out the lawsuit citing
Senator Chamber's failure

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.430
to personally serve
God with the complaint.

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:12.450
Judge Polk, referring to Nebraska law

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.530
that requires the plaintiff to have access

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:16.820
to the defendant for a
lawsuit to move forward,

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:19.820
ruled that God's lack of a
listed home address was fatal

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:22.057
to Chamber's action, quote,

00:05:22.057 --> 00:05:23.420
"Given that this court finds

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.540
that there can never
be service effectuated

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:26.890
on the named defendant,

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:29.380
this action will be
dismissed with prejudice."

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:30.770
After the ruling, Senator Chambers,

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:33.690
who graduated from law school,
but never took the bar exam,

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:36.700
highlighted what he felt was a
flaw in the Judge's reasoning

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:38.834
that God had not been properly served.

00:05:38.834 --> 00:05:42.470
"This court itself acknowledges
the existence of a God.

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:45.360
A consequence of that
acknowledgement is a recognition

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.020
of God's omnipresence.

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:48.340
Since God knows everything,

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:50.420
God has notice of this lawsuit."

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:53.000
Which is kind of hilarious
because substitution of service

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.970
through notice of publication
is actually a real thing.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:58.137
But you might be asking,

00:05:58.137 --> 00:06:00.660
"why would an avid agnostic sue God

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:01.493
in the first place?"

00:06:01.493 --> 00:06:02.670
Well, he wanted to make a point

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:05.250
about the importance of
an open court system.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.140
The Nebraska State Constitution
guarantees the right

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:09.000
of the people to seek
relief in the courts,

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.617
as provided in Article
One, Section 13, quote,

00:06:11.617 --> 00:06:13.730
"All courts shall be
open, and every person,

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:17.280
for any injury done to him
or her in his or her lands,

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:19.900
goods, person, or reputation
shall have a remedy

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.160
by due course of law
and justice administered

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:23.930
without denial or delay."

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:26.080
Senator Chambers made clear
that he was not suing God due

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.870
to any specific beef with the deity.

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:32.150
And I remind you, he didn't
even think that God existed,

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:34.860
but rather his lawsuit was
a specific form of protest.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:38.070
At the time, Nebraska legislators
were filing various bills

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:39.930
to curb so-called frivolous lawsuits

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:42.420
and Senator Chambers
believed that these laws

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.700
violated the Nebraska
Constitution's guarantee

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:45.980
of open courts, though,

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:49.430
sadly because this court
refused to issue an injunction,

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.800
floods and hurricanes have continued,

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:55.030
and God continues to evade
American law enforcement.

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:57.360
Which takes us to the time
that a hippie commune tried

00:06:57.360 --> 00:07:00.322
to involve God in a fraudulent conspiracy.

00:07:00.322 --> 00:07:03.400
The 1960s were a wild time of free love,

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.560
mind-altering drugs, and rock and roll.

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:06.890
All three of which could be found

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:09.820
at the Morningstar Commune
in Occidental, California.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:10.950
But when Johnny Law came

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.300
to the Northern California
hippie compound,

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.380
after legal woes

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:16.790
and health code violations piled up,

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.730
the owner had a unique solution,

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:21.790
deed his property to God
and make it his problem.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:24.338
Morningstar was founded
in 1966 by Louis Gottlieb,

00:07:24.338 --> 00:07:27.185
bassist for the American
folk group, The Limeliters.

00:07:27.185 --> 00:07:29.780
An ex-communist with a PhD in musicology

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:30.970
from UC Berkeley,

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.740
Gottlieb came to believe that
private property was a sin

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:36.520
and opened Morningstar to
create a welcoming space

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:37.560
for all comers.

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:39.170
Accordingly, Morningstar operated

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:40.770
under the acronym credo "LATWIDNO",

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:44.770
Land Access To Which Is Denied No One.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.400
this 31 acre clothing-optional farmland

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.930
embodied the pinnacle of the
California hippie movement.

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:51.140
But if you ask the neighbors,

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:52.890
the compounds, tents, and tree houses

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:55.760
were a walking health, safety,
and fire code violation.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:58.260
And soon, Gottlieb's legal
troubles began to pile up

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:00.910
with Morningstar's numerous
health and building violations

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:04.920
ultimately leading to fines
totally nearly $18,500,

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.557
approximately $140,000 in today's money.

00:08:07.557 --> 00:08:09.540
- They're hippies, they
don't have any money.

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:11.340
- Sonoma County even ordered all people

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.900
to vacate the commune.

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:15.320
And in an effort to
end his legal troubles,

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:17.840
Gottlieb offered to donate
Morningstar to the county,

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:19.230
but was refused.

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.060
But then in May 1969,

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.520
Gottlieb came up with a creative solution.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.135
He deeded the property
to the Almighty himself.

00:08:26.135 --> 00:08:28.350
Gottlieb argued that
God owned the property,

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.190
so it was now God's problem to deal

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.940
with the fines and code violations.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:35.205
But in July 1970, Superior
Court Judge Kenneth Iman

00:08:35.205 --> 00:08:37.860
rejected Gottlieb's novel legal theory.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.997
The law the judge wrote
requires that quote,

00:08:39.997 --> 00:08:43.115
"The grantee must be a person,
either natural or artificial,

00:08:43.115 --> 00:08:46.370
in existence at the time of
the conveyance and capable

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:47.470
of taking title."

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:48.303
And accordingly,

00:08:48.303 --> 00:08:50.270
since Gottlieb could
not affirmatively prove

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:52.900
that God was a natural person or entity,

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.860
the Judge reasoned God
had no property rights

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.300
in the the state of California.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.870
Judge Iman then voided the deed

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.700
and invalidated the property transfer.

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:01.760
And by 1971 bulldozers were sent

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:04.010
to level nearly every
building on the ranch.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.930
Gottlieb passed away in 1996

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:08.960
and the land is still owned
by his heirs to this day.

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:10.895
All of whom are corporeal people,

00:09:10.895 --> 00:09:13.210
actually existing in real life,

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:17.230
and show no signs of
omnipresence or omnipotence.

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:19.580
But you can get closer to
